            "review_title": "Review at Passio Trần Cao Vân",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20545 contributions\n1\nNew Passio Coffee for me\nOct 2024 • Solo\nCoffee shop on busy crossroad in downtown. Sharing same entrance with street food restaurant. This shop I missed somehow. Good standard cafe latte and served express way. Very many people just grab coffee drink and run away, I was sitting for a while outside enjoying Saturday lunch type traffic\nWritten October 21, 2024",
